      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This study aimed to determine the effect of PCOS upon fertility, pregnancy, and neonatal outcomes. Fertility rates may be restored to those of the background population after diagnosis. Adverse pregnancy and neonatal outcomes are more prevalent for women with PCOS independently of obesity."},
